1
00:00:04,433 --> 00:00:06,774
Metal Cardbot Commentary!

2
00:00:06,774 --> 00:00:08,708
Parting and Reunion

3
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:13,033
{Jun} Hey, guys! Jun here.

4
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:16,761
{Jun} Let's watch another episode of Metal Cardbot together.

5
00:00:16,761 --> 00:00:19,617
{Jun} It's "Metal Cardbot Commentary" time!

6
00:00:19,617 --> 00:00:21,949
Mega Trucker, setup!

7
00:00:22,449 --> 00:00:24,782
{Mega Trucker} I'm Mega Trucker!

8
00:00:24,782 --> 00:00:28,262
{Mega Trucker} I'm excited to do another one of these!

9
00:00:28,262 --> 00:00:30,860
{Jun} Great to see you again, Mega Trucker!

10
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:34,214
{Jun} Today's episode is about the first time 

11
00:00:34,214 --> 00:00:36,168
{Jun} Blue Cop's identity was revealed.

12
00:00:36,168 --> 00:00:38,603
{Jun} Let's watch the episode together!

13
00:00:38,903 --> 00:00:41,581
Huh? What was that? What's going on out here?! 

14
00:00:41,581 --> 00:00:42,465
Huh??

15
00:00:42,465 --> 00:00:43,837
Uh, Uncle Edo...

16
00:00:49,594 --> 00:00:50,962
Stay away from Jun!

17
00:00:51,962 --> 00:00:53,110
W-wait!

18
00:00:53,501 --> 00:00:55,730
Uncle Edo, were you in the repair shop?!

19
00:00:55,730 --> 00:01:00,119
I dozed off while working late... then I was woken up by a loud noise outside!

20
00:01:01,019 --> 00:01:04,328
{Mega Trucker} Wow! Being able to run like that while holding Jun! 

21
00:01:04,328 --> 00:01:07,237
{Mega Trucker} Does Edo work out?

22
00:01:07,237 --> 00:01:11,569
{Jun} I've never thought to ask him about his workout routine.

23
00:01:11,569 --> 00:01:15,371
{Mega Trucker} Next time I see him, I'll have to challenge him to tug-of-war!

24
00:01:15,371 --> 00:01:23,788
{Jun} Uh... Even for Uncle Edo, don't you think that might be a bit much?

25
00:01:26,688 --> 00:01:28,270
Please stop it, this is not safe!

26
00:01:28,270 --> 00:01:29,106
What did you say?!

27
00:01:29,106 --> 00:01:32,431
I'm tired and thirsty... Could you get me some coffee?

28
00:01:33,831 --> 00:01:34,715
Yes, sir.

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,493
So you really can make coffee!

30
00:01:41,493 --> 00:01:43,751
It's a basic skill for surviving on planet Earth.

31
00:01:43,751 --> 00:01:46,246
One sugar and no cream, okay?

32
00:01:46,246 --> 00:01:47,504
Yes, sir!

33
00:01:54,193 --> 00:01:55,056
Here you are.

34
00:02:03,079 --> 00:02:04,610
Augh, why is it so sweet?!

35
00:02:04,610 --> 00:02:07,521
{Mega Trucker} Hahaha! That Blue Cop!

36
00:02:07,521 --> 00:02:10,033
{Mega Trucker} You're telling me he can't even make coffee?!

37
00:02:10,033 --> 00:02:14,096
{Jun} Mega Trucker! Do you know how to make coffee, too?

38
00:02:14,096 --> 00:02:15,564
{Mega Trucker} Of course!

39
00:02:15,564 --> 00:02:18,832
{Mega Trucker} Just get a mouthful of coffee, water, and sugar

40
00:02:18,832 --> 00:02:21,419
{Mega Trucker} and gulp it right down! How'dya like that?

41
00:02:21,419 --> 00:02:22,596
{Jun} Huh?! 

42
00:02:22,596 --> 00:02:26,773
{Jun} Maybe if you had a coffee maker for a mouth...?

43
00:02:31,073 --> 00:02:32,592
There's a bad traffic jam.

44
00:02:32,592 --> 00:02:34,441
Augh, but I'm in a hurry!

45
00:02:34,441 --> 00:02:35,582
I'll do my best.

46
00:02:35,582 --> 00:02:37,864
Wait, what are you going to do?

47
00:02:43,512 --> 00:02:45,001
Woah, woah, woah! Watch out!

48
00:02:53,165 --> 00:02:53,744
Oh!

49
00:02:57,277 --> 00:02:58,393
Hang on, stop the car!

50
00:02:58,393 --> 00:03:00,099
Come on, I said stop!

51
00:03:05,926 --> 00:03:07,985
{Jun} Blue Cop, don't you think...

52
00:03:07,985 --> 00:03:10,243
{Jun} you were driving a little fast?

53
00:03:10,243 --> 00:03:11,116
{Mega Trucker} Jun!

54
00:03:11,116 --> 00:03:14,560
{Mega Trucker} Y'think he's been in his fair share of racing competitions?

55
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,072
{Jun} Mega Trucker!

56
00:03:16,072 --> 00:03:18,818
{Jun} Blue Cop might be upset if he hears this!

57
00:03:18,818 --> 00:03:19,916
{Mega Trucker} Hey~

58
00:03:19,916 --> 00:03:23,449
{Mega Trucker} How else can you dodge traffic like that while going so fast!?

59
00:03:23,449 --> 00:03:25,645
{Jun} Eh...

60
00:03:25,645 --> 00:03:29,433
If something happens to Jun, how will I explain it to his parents?

61
00:03:29,433 --> 00:03:32,137
So, you should leave. Go back to your planet!

62
00:03:59,359 --> 00:04:01,231
That was the wobbly truck!

63
00:04:01,231 --> 00:04:03,356
Oh man... was the driver dozing off?

64
00:04:09,164 --> 00:04:11,064
Oh no! We need to go alert the train, quick!

65
00:04:12,899 --> 00:04:14,910
Blue Cop... where are you...

66
00:04:19,627 --> 00:04:22,863
You wouldn't mind if I used the siren in this situation, would you?

67
00:04:22,863 --> 00:04:23,832
Blue Cop!

68
00:04:24,798 --> 00:04:26,559
Scoot over. I'll help you with that!

69
00:04:36,392 --> 00:04:37,714
Just a little more!

70
00:04:37,714 --> 00:04:41,538
{Jun} It was really scary when that truck got overturned...!

71
00:04:41,538 --> 00:04:45,437
{Mega Trucker} If you get tired while driving, you should pull over and take a break!

72
00:04:45,437 --> 00:04:46,514
{Jun} That's right!

73
00:04:46,514 --> 00:04:49,590
{Jun} No matter how urgent the situation, you should never drive while drowsy!

74
00:04:49,590 --> 00:04:50,822
{Mega Trucker} Hey Jun, 

75
00:04:50,822 --> 00:04:53,254
{Mega Trucker} who are you talking to?

76
00:04:53,254 --> 00:04:54,729
{Jun} Uh... 

77
00:04:54,729 --> 00:04:57,804
{Jun} Wouldn't it be good for everyone to hear?

78
00:05:00,304 --> 00:05:02,359
{Jun} Well, how was that?

79
00:05:02,359 --> 00:05:04,772
{Jun} Blue Cop and I parted ways for a little while,

80
00:05:04,772 --> 00:05:08,384
{Jun} but we met again and were able to solve the crisis together!

81
00:05:08,384 --> 00:05:12,813
{Jun} Now then, please look forward to the next "Metal Cardbot Commentary"!

